## Frontmatter (OKF v0.2)

Every page carries YAML frontmatter. Required:

```yaml
---
type: entity | concept | source | synthesis | overview | index | log | attestation
title: "Human-readable title"
description: "One-sentence summary"
domain: <domain-slug> | cross-domain
tags: [topic-a, topic-b]
created: YYYY-MM-DD
updated: YYYY-MM-DD
okf_version: "0.2"
---
```

Recommended (provenance + trust):

```yaml
sources:                  # what this page derives from
  - id: <source-path>
    title: "Source title"
    author: "author"
generated:
  by: <agent-name>/<version>   # e.g. reference_agent/gemini-2.5-pro
  at: YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ
verified:                 # absent → unverified
  - by: human:<id> | process:<id> | <agent>/<version>
    at: YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ
status: draft | machine-confirmed | human-reviewed | stale
usage_window: { from: YYYY-MM-DD, to: YYYY-MM-DD }
```

**Trust tiers (OKF):**
- No `verified` key ⇒ **unverified**
- `verified` only by non-`human:` actors ⇒ **machine-confirmed**
- `verified` by a `human:<id>` actor ⇒ **human-reviewed**

## Page types and naming

| Type | Location | Naming |
|------|----------|--------|
| source | `wiki/sources/` | `YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md` |
| entity | `wiki/entities/` or domain folder | `<slug>.md` |
| concept | `wiki/concepts/` or domain folder | `<slug>.md` |
| synthesis | `wiki/synthesis/` | `<slug>.md` |
| overview | domain folder | `_overview.md` |

Every page must have outbound `[[wikilinks]]` (except `log.md`). Prefer updating
existing pages over creating duplicates.

