## index.md and log.md

- **index.md** is content-oriented: every page listed with link + one-line summary,
  grouped by category. Update on every ingest.
- **log.md** is chronological and append-only. Entries start with
  `## [YYYY-MM-DD] <op> | <Title>` so they stay parseable with
  `grep "^## \[" wiki/log.md | tail -5`.

## Rules

- **RAG constraint**: All agent searches and answers within the vault/wiki are strictly based on indexed information in `wiki/` guided by `AGENTS.md`. External/web searches are strictly prohibited unless explicitly requested by the user.
- Never modify anything in `raw/`, `Clippings/`, or `Agent Client/`.
- Every new page needs full YAML frontmatter.
- Every page needs outbound `[[wikilinks]]`; every ingest correlates its touched
  pages via wikilinks and tags.
- Flag contradictions explicitly; never silently overwrite.
- Answers and insights compound: file them back into `wiki/`.
- Co-evolve this schema as conventions mature.
